WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
Release-Group "Mania" presents

00:00:25.560 --> 01:10:21.420
Mania

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Alchemy

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Shower

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:50.700
Hold on, madam

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:52.540
Don't close your eyes

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:53.830
Don't fall asleep

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.260
I have to make Do Hwa mine. If she gets pregnant, then the child is mine

00:01:06.350 --> 00:01:08.350
Thanks to you

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:12.270
last week was incredible

00:01:17.230 --> 00:01:18.690
Do Hwa soon

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:21.990
will give birth to my son

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:25.530
Your Majesty

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:30.040
Do you remember the prediction I received on the day of my coronation?

00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:34.120
You said that I would have a son

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:37.960
who will have the energy of the royal star

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:42.210
The prediction was wrong. It's impossible

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:45.880
No

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:50.060
This must become true

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:54.180
I will have a son thanks to your alchemy of souls

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:57.690
Remember this

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:00.770
Do Hwa carries to term and gives birth

00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:04.150
my son

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:08.530
He will be mine

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:49.140
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:51.140
Assistant coordinators: Sana, Martini

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:53.140
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee, tommo

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:10.640
The star in the center of the Big Dipper, which means the secrets of nature,

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:15.350
appears only when the sky is filled with the energy of Deho waters

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:26.190
My son will be born when this star shines

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:39.960
From now on, I forbid Chan Wook from entering Sosnovy Bor

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:42.630
One hit left

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:44.090
And apply this last one yourself

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:01.060
Moo Deok

00:04:02.310 --> 00:04:05.690
Is the young master still silent?

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:10.700
Yes. They hit me on the back, and it felt like my tongue had been hurt

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:13.200
He burst into tears even when he hit his finger

00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:15.950
And after a hundred blows he is silent, like a fish

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:17.120
I'm worried

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:20.290
He's a crybaby, so I think he can still bear it

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:25.750
It's not his back that hurts, it's his heart

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:30.800
He was abandoned by the man he considered his father.

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:32.430
Imagine how he feels

00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:35.550
How abandoned he feels

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:01.460
Be glad you got spanked

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:05.330
They won't be able to take the energy right now

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:07.340
You have more time to train

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:19.470
Owner

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:21.310
Are you okay?

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:43.750
Moo Deok, look

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:46.120
I think these circles on the water are my fault

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:52.380
It's just ripples

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:56.890
Why doesn't it work? I trained my breathing

00:05:56.970 --> 00:05:59.300
So this is what you were doing in silence

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:02.600
And I thought you were drowning in an ocean of sadness because you were kicked out

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:05.270
- I was wrong
- Am I drowning in an ocean of sadness?

00:06:05.350 --> 00:06:07.350
I've been abandoned since birth

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:09.690
And it’s not the first time I’ve been chased away from somewhere.

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:11.230
It doesn't bother me

00:06:17.030 --> 00:06:18.530
You'll see

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:22.040
I'll make them beg me to return to Sosnovy Bor

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:25.120
Idiocy is sometimes useful, apparently

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:26.710
This is a show of strength!

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:33.090
Why is it so hot here?

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:35.590
Hot? I'm cold

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:40.140
Why did the water get so hot?

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:43.970
Why are you burning?

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:48.690
I feel strange. The temperature is rising

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:50.110
This is energy

00:06:51.230 --> 00:06:52.440
But so soon?

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:56.900
It's about spanking

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:59.160
Because of her, there was a surge of energy

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:01.580
Glad you got spanked

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:06.250
Moo Deok, I'm on fire

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:09.670
You'll be hot while the energy turns into heat

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:11.880
And it will be cold when it cools down

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:14.590
The energy will only be yours if you handle it

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:18.550
Breathe slowly

00:07:26.390 --> 00:07:27.810
This is cold water

00:07:41.490 --> 00:07:42.620
Moo Deok,

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:45.040
Is the young master still bathing?

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:47.080
An hour has almost passed

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:51.880
If she finds out, she will tell everything in Sosnovy Bor, and we will lose energy.

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:52.830
Medicinal herbs

00:07:54.380 --> 00:07:56.630
He bathes in the herbs

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:58.920
I prepared the herbs

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:01.840
and he bathes in them so that the wounds heal

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:03.930
How's that?

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:06.560
Good idea

00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:10.730
stand

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:19.740
Why is the water cold then?

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:21.030
What?

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:24.070
The water should have cooled down in the past hour

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:26.080
Why do you still bring him cold instead of hot?

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:30.250
Does he have a fever?

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:33.250
Mister...

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:39.460
She's icy

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:41.760
How did you let this happen?

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:43.300
What if he gets sick?

00:08:50.140 --> 00:08:53.060
Boiling water suddenly turned ice cold

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:54.230
Mister

00:08:55.770 --> 00:08:57.070
Where is he?

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:05.280
Mister, are you okay?

00:09:05.990 --> 00:09:07.200
Yes

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:10.540
Swimming relaxed my body and I started to feel sleepy.

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:15.880
What are you worth? Prepare a place to sleep

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:20.460
Cold. Now he's freezing

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:29.770
I'm cold. It's like I'm turning into ice

00:09:30.680 --> 00:09:34.390
The cold is spreading. Your energy is growing faster than I thought

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:36.810
Keep breathing

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:03.970
It's so cold it makes your mind go blank

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:08.260
Hold on. You should

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:13.180
Chan Wook! Don't fall asleep!

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:15.060
If you fall asleep, you will freeze to death

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:16.270
Get up

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:20.070
Breathe

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:34.540
Uncle, Yul and I are Uka’s only friends

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:37.120
And Sosnovy Bor is the only place he calls home.

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:40.000
Let him come back

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:41.800
He still can't train

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:43.960
They won't accept him anywhere,

00:10:44.050 --> 00:10:46.340
when they find out that they kicked me out of here too

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:49.760
Stop talking about him

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:53.100
From now on, focus on Nomads and Soulswallowers

00:11:01.940 --> 00:11:04.230
He's like stone

00:11:05.530 --> 00:11:06.900
So he was petrified

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:11.780
When nomads run wild

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:15.000
they lose energy, so they suck it out of people

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:19.290
It's like an evil spirit

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:22.000
It's clear why you ban this witchcraft

00:11:22.090 --> 00:11:24.960
Alchemy of souls was not originally witchcraft

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:27.170
It can be mastered

00:11:27.260 --> 00:11:30.680
only having mastered Chipsa, Ryusa, Chisa and finally Hwansu

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:32.260
Hwansu... This is...

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:35.770
When can you exchange fire for water and vice versa?

00:11:35.850 --> 00:11:38.060
- People can't do this
- Exactly

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:40.730
But Master So Kyung, the founder of Sosnovy Bor, was able to

00:11:40.810 --> 00:11:42.560
There was another one

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:43.690
Who?

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:45.690
Otherwise I’ll tell you the name and you’ll understand

00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:49.820
Who dared to try this alchemy

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:52.570
on our poor student?

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:56.370
He was supposed to work in Jeonbugwan, read the stars

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:58.710
He's been there often for the past few months.

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:02.210
Exactly. There are also those who caught Nak Su's people

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:04.710
We couldn’t, but these guys seemed to be waiting for them

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:07.210
I'm sure they have something to do with it

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:09.420
to this soul swallower

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:14.180
Yul, Dan Gu, watch Jeonbugwan

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:16.100
Suddenly you notice something strange

00:12:16.680 --> 00:12:17.560
- Yes
- Yes

00:12:20.060 --> 00:12:21.650
What's wrong with her?

00:12:21.730 --> 00:12:24.020
The door has been working intermittently since Uk broke it.

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:27.150
- Chan Wook...
- Don't move!

00:12:27.860 --> 00:12:29.070
The floor will fall through

00:12:32.490 --> 00:12:33.820
Don't move

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:36.120
Wait until the door is completely closed

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:38.080
Chan Wook!

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:41.500
I told you not to move!

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:43.330
Help me!

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:46.590
Stand still

00:12:47.960 --> 00:12:49.010
Chan Wook

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:22.250
Lie down for now

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:42.060
Sapsari

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:44.230
Come out

00:13:44.940 --> 00:13:46.650
Come with me

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:32.940
Glad you're back

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:40.870
I'll give you a treat if you find the nomad

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:42.450
I hope we work together

00:15:12.650 --> 00:15:13.780
Moo Deok

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:17.360
If I freeze to death

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:20.620
take my energy

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:24.910
if you can

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:29.080
If I could, I would have killed you long ago and taken you away

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.670
I'm freezing here

00:15:35.260 --> 00:15:37.260
and you throw cold phrases

00:15:39.260 --> 00:15:40.760
Say something warm

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:43.430
Lost your mind?

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:44.810
You'll say the same

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:51.730
Chan Wook, open your eyes

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:55.440
Okay, I'll say something warm

00:15:58.360 --> 00:16:01.820
Where I lived there was a huge tree

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:06.620
There was a nest at the very top

00:16:07.290 --> 00:16:09.040
There was one egg in it

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:11.920
Did you eat it?

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:14.920
My words will make you feel warm

00:16:20.300 --> 00:16:22.970
Mother bird flew in and sat on him

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:31.850
I'm like an egg at the very top of the tree

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:36.860
I don't know anyone

00:16:38.780 --> 00:16:40.650
and I'm powerless

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:47.410
You're the only one who can take care of me

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:52.710
My life

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:55.840
in your hands

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:04.590
How warm

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:12.020
Carry on

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:19.480
And there was also a cave

00:17:21.780 --> 00:17:24.030
A bear cub lived in it

00:17:55.060 --> 00:17:57.440
You can't even pick up your father's sword

00:17:57.520 --> 00:17:59.270
How do you want to learn spells?

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:03.490
No one in Daeho can stand up to your father.

00:18:03.570 --> 00:18:05.700
and open the gates of your energy

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:08.580
This is the fate that was given to you

00:18:09.580 --> 00:18:11.160
your father

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:33.680
You're not ready yet

00:18:39.980 --> 00:18:42.440
draw a magic sword

00:18:43.070 --> 00:18:46.150
You must master Ryusu and learn how to release energy

00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:50.160
You can't do this yet because you can't control your energy.

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:53.790
My father left this sword when he abandoned me

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:56.080
I will get to Sosnovy Bor only by exposing it

00:18:58.830 --> 00:19:00.920
I want to do this and show them

00:19:02.130 --> 00:19:03.460
Is this a sign of stupidity?

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:04.840
No, strength

00:19:07.090 --> 00:19:09.970
Be strong, Chan Wook

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:30.160
Your Highness

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:32.700
We arrived at Jang Gan's house, Gwangju Jeonbugwan

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:38.250
Young master!

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:42.670
You have a guest

00:19:43.380 --> 00:19:44.300
Who?

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:47.630
The Crown Prince has arrived

00:20:09.990 --> 00:20:12.820
The weather is absolutely perfect

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:16.080
for fishing with Wook near Gyeongcheongdaeho

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:20.960
I wonder if he's come to his senses

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:24.630
I decided to visit him since I was worried

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:26.380
What are you up to?

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:29.170
I want to check something

00:20:29.260 --> 00:20:31.380
I said something to his maid

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:35.010
We visit him as friends,

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:36.680
why are you here?

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:39.930
I came across you by accident

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:43.690
And I also have something to find fault with him for.

00:20:43.770 --> 00:20:46.320
I see, I was going to get him

00:20:46.900 --> 00:20:48.440
What's in the package?

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:53.490
Medicine for his wounds

00:20:54.030 --> 00:20:57.830
First you give him medicine, and then you sit on his ears

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:01.330
Incredible

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:05.540
Have you come for Nak Su's sword?

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:07.550
The king entrusted it to Jeonbugwan

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:11.300
Jin Mu, the deputy of Gwangju should keep it, since Gwangju himself is gone

00:21:15.510 --> 00:21:18.310
Since you came here in person, I will give it to you

00:21:18.390 --> 00:21:19.470
Take it away

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:20.930
Bring the sword

00:21:22.730 --> 00:21:23.850
That's not all

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:26.980
There's another sword here that you can't draw

00:21:28.650 --> 00:21:32.150
The late king granted it to Gwangju Chang Gang

00:21:32.780 --> 00:21:34.360
I want to take him too

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:37.240
But it belongs to his father

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:39.660
Sword by right of the young master

00:21:39.740 --> 00:21:41.290
But he was never trusted with this sword

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:44.870
Previously it was stored in Sosnovy Bor

00:21:44.960 --> 00:21:47.880
You took it when you got kicked out, am I right?

00:21:49.590 --> 00:21:53.090
The Royal Palace will keep it until a new Gwangju is elected

00:21:54.930 --> 00:21:56.050
Bring me a sword

00:22:03.390 --> 00:22:04.890
I can't give it away

00:22:06.520 --> 00:22:10.320
As you know, I am not recognized as my father's son

00:22:11.860 --> 00:22:14.610
If I also lose my sword, it won’t end well for me.

00:22:15.740 --> 00:22:18.240
I will keep it, even if only as decoration.

00:22:21.870 --> 00:22:23.910
I have to pick him up

00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:26.960
and you refuse. Nothing to do

00:22:29.290 --> 00:22:30.960
The winner will take the sword

00:22:49.020 --> 00:22:51.650
You're not particularly trained to fight for a real battle.

00:22:58.530 --> 00:23:00.700
Can you push me beyond this line?

00:23:01.280 --> 00:23:02.580
I'll leave

00:23:17.300 --> 00:23:21.930
I'm sure you were expecting me to grovel before you.

00:23:23.260 --> 00:23:26.600
Going against you is a sign of stupidity

00:23:26.680 --> 00:23:29.310
Still, some consider it a show of strength

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:30.440
So I'll try

00:24:23.820 --> 00:24:25.160
This is energy

00:24:25.240 --> 00:24:26.540
It's about spanking

00:24:26.620 --> 00:24:28.660
Because of her, there was a surge of energy

00:24:29.540 --> 00:24:30.540
Glad you got spanked

00:24:31.170 --> 00:24:34.880
Okay, you can hit as much as you want

00:25:54.000 --> 00:25:55.290
Back!

00:25:55.920 --> 00:25:57.670
Carefully! It's from the chamber pot!

00:26:10.060 --> 00:26:11.600
What have you done?

00:26:13.020 --> 00:26:13.890
Who is this?

00:26:15.310 --> 00:26:18.150
- I serve the master
- How dare the maid interfere?

00:26:21.860 --> 00:26:23.280
Sorry, Your Highness

00:26:23.360 --> 00:26:25.030
My maid is impudent

00:26:27.620 --> 00:26:28.530
What is this?

00:26:31.330 --> 00:26:33.790
Disgusting

00:26:33.870 --> 00:26:35.870
Come home, change clothes

00:26:36.370 --> 00:26:38.540
- What?
- You stepped over the line

00:26:41.630 --> 00:26:44.550
Of course, you didn't want to get dirty, but still,

00:26:44.630 --> 00:26:45.800
it's a loss

00:26:45.880 --> 00:26:49.260
Keep your word and leave me my father's sword

00:26:50.260 --> 00:26:51.810
As you can see,

00:26:51.890 --> 00:26:54.430
I won’t be able to accompany you because I’m seriously wounded.

00:27:02.150 --> 00:27:03.440
What's going on?

00:27:04.440 --> 00:27:05.650
Okay

00:27:05.740 --> 00:27:07.570
I will keep my word and leave the sword

00:27:08.280 --> 00:27:09.280
But,

00:27:10.370 --> 00:27:11.910
I will punish her

00:27:17.120 --> 00:27:19.710
I won't forgive her for dirty clothes

00:28:12.600 --> 00:28:15.140
I drew my sword...

00:28:29.190 --> 00:28:30.910
Chan Wook!

00:28:30.990 --> 00:28:33.570
I thought you couldn't cast spells

00:28:33.660 --> 00:28:35.410
and you fooled us all

00:28:35.990 --> 00:28:36.830
No...

00:28:37.450 --> 00:28:39.540
What?

00:28:46.630 --> 00:28:48.050
You!

00:28:48.130 --> 00:28:50.420
How dare you raise a sword against the Crown Prince?

00:28:50.510 --> 00:28:52.680
- No, it's not me
- Uk, put down your sword!

00:28:53.680 --> 00:28:55.890
- Put it down now
- I'm trying

00:28:56.470 --> 00:28:57.470
But I can't

00:29:20.870 --> 00:29:22.480
Stop now, idiot!

00:29:23.500 --> 00:29:25.170
I don't control him!

00:29:37.640 --> 00:29:38.640
Chan Wook,

00:29:39.640 --> 00:29:40.890
die!

00:29:50.780 --> 00:29:51.820
Stop

00:30:00.200 --> 00:30:02.290
- Stop it
- I don't control my hand

00:30:02.370 --> 00:30:03.710
What?

00:30:05.120 --> 00:30:07.130
I... I didn't mean to

00:30:07.630 --> 00:30:10.000
Young master!

00:30:17.010 --> 00:30:18.010
This is a binding bracelet

00:30:18.100 --> 00:30:20.760
Its weight will keep your hand under control

00:30:27.150 --> 00:30:30.820
His energy poured into one hand and was uncontrollable

00:30:32.440 --> 00:30:33.610
Untie him!

00:30:36.160 --> 00:30:37.200
Chan Wook

00:30:38.280 --> 00:30:39.410
Grab your sword

00:30:41.620 --> 00:30:42.580
Your Highness

00:30:42.660 --> 00:30:44.660
He's no match for you

00:30:44.750 --> 00:30:46.330
Are you witnesses to this

00:30:46.420 --> 00:30:48.960
He pointed his father's sword at me

00:30:49.040 --> 00:30:51.590
He just couldn't control his energy

00:30:51.670 --> 00:30:54.170
- He even hit me, you saw
- Be silent!

00:30:56.180 --> 00:30:58.760
Your Highness, you were the first to point the blade of your sword at him

00:30:59.350 --> 00:31:01.390
The sword you brandished in anger is broken

00:31:01.470 --> 00:31:03.890
You must observe the customs of the magicians and return to the palace

00:31:07.020 --> 00:31:09.980
How dare you resist my will?

00:31:12.400 --> 00:31:16.030
Chan, Jin, Seo and Park. All four are in front of me

00:31:16.950 --> 00:31:19.570
I refuse to leave defeated

00:31:19.660 --> 00:31:20.820
What will you do?

00:31:22.080 --> 00:31:24.830
All four of you attack

00:31:32.630 --> 00:31:34.510
It's bad

00:31:34.590 --> 00:31:37.590
It looks like our families have gone against the royal family

00:31:37.670 --> 00:31:39.590
Things are getting more serious

00:31:39.680 --> 00:31:41.260
Cho Young provoked him

00:31:41.350 --> 00:31:43.010
What have I done?

00:31:43.560 --> 00:31:46.390
Then we'll just give him Uka

00:31:46.480 --> 00:31:47.560
Your Highness

00:31:48.270 --> 00:31:50.690
These are the main families of Daeho

00:31:51.310 --> 00:31:52.730
The king will be furious

00:31:52.820 --> 00:31:54.400
if he hears about this fight

00:31:55.900 --> 00:31:58.240
So what? Should I just leave?

00:31:59.450 --> 00:32:01.530
You should have stopped me earlier

00:32:15.670 --> 00:32:16.630
Moo Deok...

00:32:25.100 --> 00:32:26.770
I'm terribly sorry, Your Highness

00:32:28.140 --> 00:32:31.150
How dare I, such a rat, spill feces

00:32:31.230 --> 00:32:32.480
on your clothes?

00:32:37.650 --> 00:32:39.950
I'm really sorry. Very

00:32:40.030 --> 00:32:41.160
Go away

00:32:41.240 --> 00:32:43.530
Disappear. You stink

00:32:44.580 --> 00:32:46.910
Forgive us

00:32:50.750 --> 00:32:55.540
As a sign of sincere regret, I will drink what's left

00:32:56.460 --> 00:32:58.710
So forgive us

00:33:08.680 --> 00:33:09.640
Moo Dok!

00:33:11.980 --> 00:33:14.100
Why are you drinking?

00:33:16.860 --> 00:33:17.820
Mister!

00:33:21.070 --> 00:33:22.610
I have to drink this

00:33:24.490 --> 00:33:25.820
What?

00:33:27.620 --> 00:33:29.200
It's not like that

00:33:29.290 --> 00:33:31.120
Why you?

00:33:31.210 --> 00:33:33.710
I'm the reason for this, that's why I drink

00:33:33.790 --> 00:33:36.630
Not at all. His Highness is angry with me

00:33:36.710 --> 00:33:38.750
I must drink

00:33:42.380 --> 00:33:44.380
And there's a lot...

00:33:45.220 --> 00:33:47.890
Come here, I'll have a drink

00:33:47.970 --> 00:33:49.100
Shall we share then?

00:33:50.430 --> 00:33:52.640
Why share this?

00:33:52.730 --> 00:33:54.060
What?

00:33:54.140 --> 00:33:55.230
Take it all

00:33:57.360 --> 00:33:59.530
Then I'll drink a little and give it to you

00:33:59.610 --> 00:34:02.320
Help me lift it, my arm can’t move

00:34:06.320 --> 00:34:07.160
Mister!

00:34:11.830 --> 00:34:13.250
I you...

00:34:14.500 --> 00:34:15.460
I drink

00:34:16.630 --> 00:34:17.580
Forget it

00:34:17.670 --> 00:34:19.550
Why do you need it?

00:34:19.630 --> 00:34:20.750
Get out of here

00:34:20.840 --> 00:34:23.090
How many are there?

00:34:23.170 --> 00:34:24.800
Do you want me to help?

00:34:25.430 --> 00:34:27.720
- Seriously?
- Come here

00:34:31.390 --> 00:34:32.470
This is true from the pot...

00:34:35.850 --> 00:34:37.060
Your Highness

00:34:37.150 --> 00:34:39.150
How dare we compete with you?

00:34:39.860 --> 00:34:41.280
Do they really need to drink?

00:34:41.360 --> 00:34:43.610
this crap as an apology?

00:34:46.990 --> 00:34:48.370
So that you

00:34:49.490 --> 00:34:52.700
Stop it. I'm sick of you

00:34:55.160 --> 00:34:56.330
Let's go

00:34:58.080 --> 00:35:01.460
His Highness is leaving! Bow your heads!

00:35:07.180 --> 00:35:09.640
Why did he even come?

00:35:10.260 --> 00:35:12.220
Behind the sword of Nak Su

00:35:12.930 --> 00:35:14.850
And then suddenly he started a fight

00:35:15.520 --> 00:35:18.350
Today he left, but knowing his character,

00:35:18.850 --> 00:35:20.520
he will definitely take revenge

00:35:24.030 --> 00:35:26.360
-Are you okay?
- He hit me so many times

00:35:26.450 --> 00:35:28.990
And you hit me hard!

00:35:31.450 --> 00:35:33.160
-Are you okay?
- I think so

00:35:33.240 --> 00:35:34.490
- It hurts
- Does it hurt?

00:35:34.580 --> 00:35:35.910
- Does it hurt here?
- It hurts

00:35:36.000 --> 00:35:38.580
- It hurts everywhere
- Don't touch him

00:35:41.540 --> 00:35:44.380
Your Highness!

00:35:48.340 --> 00:35:49.640
What do you want?

00:35:50.510 --> 00:35:53.510
You came for the Nak Su sword, here you go

00:35:55.390 --> 00:35:56.480
You're right

00:35:57.310 --> 00:35:58.850
I came to pick him up

00:35:58.940 --> 00:36:02.770
I brought it so you don't have to come back a second time.

00:36:02.860 --> 00:36:04.230
Please take it

00:36:04.980 --> 00:36:08.280
Are you telling me to take what I came for and not come back?

00:36:09.530 --> 00:36:13.580
You are so smart, insightful and strong

00:36:13.660 --> 00:36:15.870
Are you laughing at me because I lost?

00:36:15.950 --> 00:36:18.790
Lost? You got what you wanted

00:36:18.870 --> 00:36:20.870
And he lost it

00:36:20.960 --> 00:36:23.960
The winner here is you

00:36:26.460 --> 00:36:30.050
She's right, Your Highness. You won

00:36:30.880 --> 00:36:33.100
Congratulations, Your Highness

00:36:35.180 --> 00:36:36.470
So be it

00:36:40.440 --> 00:36:42.600
Besides, you are very generous

00:36:42.690 --> 00:36:45.650
There is no such noble person in the world as you

00:36:50.200 --> 00:36:51.360
What's your name?

00:36:53.490 --> 00:36:55.120
Moo Deok, Your Highness

00:36:56.280 --> 00:36:57.290
Moo Deok

00:36:57.790 --> 00:36:59.620
You spilled water from a pot on me

00:36:59.710 --> 00:37:01.330
From now on I will call you Won Moo Deok

00:37:02.000 --> 00:37:05.960
Just like your name, you stink of dirt

00:37:12.590 --> 00:37:14.340
You even gave me a name

00:37:14.430 --> 00:37:17.890
Thank you very much for your kindness

00:37:22.310 --> 00:37:23.690
Goodbye, Your Highness

00:37:25.770 --> 00:37:26.730
Forward

00:37:35.820 --> 00:37:39.330
My student is still too weak to fight you

00:37:39.410 --> 00:37:43.080
Until he gets stronger, he better not ruin his relationship with you

00:37:50.210 --> 00:37:53.010
You easily fall in love or ingratiate yourself with others.

00:37:53.090 --> 00:37:54.470
for your master?

00:37:54.550 --> 00:37:57.140
I couldn't fight him, so I doused him

00:37:59.140 --> 00:38:02.020
I stink, you better not come near me

00:38:08.110 --> 00:38:08.940
Dry yourself

00:38:12.570 --> 00:38:15.280
How dare I stain the thing of the man I love?

00:38:16.280 --> 00:38:17.530
No thanks

00:38:53.490 --> 00:38:55.530
I really became Stinky Moo Deok

00:39:01.490 --> 00:39:04.370
You wash your face too, you probably stink

00:39:21.430 --> 00:39:24.520
Master I finally did it

00:39:50.830 --> 00:39:54.920
Gwiga was stolen from Jinyoewon

00:39:56.050 --> 00:39:59.800
Only members of the Jin family can open this door.

00:40:00.510 --> 00:40:03.760
They must have called him from outside

00:40:05.470 --> 00:40:06.890
Theft in Jinyeowon?

00:40:06.980 --> 00:40:10.150
You grieved for your dead daughter for years,

00:40:10.230 --> 00:40:13.610
it must have weakened you

00:40:14.730 --> 00:40:16.940
Shameless rude

00:40:17.530 --> 00:40:20.990
You may be illegitimate, but you're still part of the Jin family.

00:40:21.070 --> 00:40:23.160
How dare you slander your stepsister?

00:40:23.240 --> 00:40:24.370
Scoundrel

00:40:24.450 --> 00:40:25.740
I am the deputy of Gwangju

00:40:25.830 --> 00:40:28.460
I'll appreciate it if you show more respect

00:40:36.380 --> 00:40:39.670
Sir, please go out into the yard. Chan Wook came to see you

00:41:01.150 --> 00:41:03.110
I forbade him to appear here

00:41:03.200 --> 00:41:06.740
Why did you bring him with you?

00:41:07.660 --> 00:41:09.450
There's something you need to see

00:41:16.670 --> 00:41:18.550
This is my father's sword

00:41:19.340 --> 00:41:22.720
When I was younger you said you'd accept me if I could bare it

00:41:23.390 --> 00:41:24.340
Do you remember?

00:42:05.300 --> 00:42:08.010
I thought he only recently opened the gates of his energy

00:42:08.720 --> 00:42:11.730
I see that he has mastered the flow of my energy

00:42:12.390 --> 00:42:14.480
What you would expect from Chang Gan's son

00:42:14.560 --> 00:42:16.690
He mastered Ryusu in the blink of an eye

00:42:17.400 --> 00:42:20.650
Please take me with you

00:42:21.480 --> 00:42:22.400
master

00:42:27.240 --> 00:42:28.870
What's on your hand?

00:42:29.450 --> 00:42:31.700
His energy is concentrated in his right hand

00:42:31.790 --> 00:42:33.080
He doesn't control her yet

00:42:33.160 --> 00:42:35.120
so we put a restraint bracelet on him

00:42:46.720 --> 00:42:48.680
Take it off

00:42:49.600 --> 00:42:52.140
If we take him off, his hand will no longer obey

00:42:52.220 --> 00:42:55.060
Let him take it off later, after training

00:42:56.100 --> 00:42:57.230
Shoot

00:43:23.630 --> 00:43:27.050
I want to see how you hold a sword

00:43:58.540 --> 00:44:00.460
Tie his hand

00:44:13.600 --> 00:44:15.890
Are you... okay?

00:44:16.930 --> 00:44:18.850
What's the point of drawing a sword?

00:44:20.810 --> 00:44:22.560
if you can't even hold it?

00:44:28.740 --> 00:44:30.660
He just can't control her yet

00:44:30.740 --> 00:44:32.910
But he has incredible strength

00:44:32.990 --> 00:44:34.490
He even defeated the Crown Prince

00:44:35.540 --> 00:44:37.910
He broke His Highness's sword

00:44:38.500 --> 00:44:40.540
Although he had already mastered Ryusu long ago

00:44:40.620 --> 00:44:42.170
Uk won

00:44:43.710 --> 00:44:45.920
Jin Cho Young, don't interfere

00:44:47.090 --> 00:44:48.460
Yes, mother

00:44:49.340 --> 00:44:54.100
Wook, did you really point your sword at the Crown Prince?

00:44:54.680 --> 00:44:56.430
Ne Wook started a fight

00:44:56.510 --> 00:44:58.390
You pointed a sword at the Crown Prince?!

00:45:00.440 --> 00:45:01.520
Yes

00:45:02.810 --> 00:45:05.520
His Highness wanted to take the Gwangju Sword

00:45:05.610 --> 00:45:07.480
It was an argument

00:45:08.190 --> 00:45:10.150
Even the Crown Prince forgave him

00:45:11.360 --> 00:45:15.660
His Highness's sword was broken, but Uk still pointed his at him!

00:45:15.740 --> 00:45:18.580
He put the Crown Prince's life in danger

00:45:18.660 --> 00:45:19.660
We were there too

00:45:20.790 --> 00:45:21.870
We were able to stop him

00:45:21.960 --> 00:45:24.000
This means that the four of you were watching,

00:45:24.080 --> 00:45:26.250
how they mocked His Highness

00:45:28.710 --> 00:45:31.720
This is an insult to the royal family!

00:45:34.720 --> 00:45:36.510
Lock up Chan Wook

00:45:39.390 --> 00:45:41.560
It is uncontrollable and dangerous

00:45:41.640 --> 00:45:42.770
Yes

00:46:02.210 --> 00:46:04.170
It was worth opening the gates of energy,

00:46:04.250 --> 00:46:08.170
How Chang Wook started threatening the Crown Prince

00:46:11.170 --> 00:46:14.010
Jeonbugwan won't leave it that easily

00:47:14.070 --> 00:47:16.860
You haven't treated the wound yet, you've lost a lot of blood

00:47:19.240 --> 00:47:21.620
How's your hand?

00:47:25.330 --> 00:47:27.540
The bracelet doesn't allow her to move

00:47:28.370 --> 00:47:29.630
But I'm fine

00:47:31.380 --> 00:47:34.550
You were able to master the energy flow of Master Ho Yeom

00:47:34.630 --> 00:47:36.130
in such a short time

00:47:37.300 --> 00:47:38.510
I'm really impressed

00:47:41.140 --> 00:47:43.060
My body was on fire at first,

00:47:43.640 --> 00:47:46.100
and then it seemed to be covered with ice

00:47:47.850 --> 00:47:50.100
How are your wounds from the spanking?

00:47:50.190 --> 00:47:51.520
Do they hurt?

00:47:54.360 --> 00:47:58.400
The spanking seemed to help gather some energy.

00:48:00.360 --> 00:48:02.490
The Crown Prince has dealt me many blows,

00:48:04.450 --> 00:48:07.580
after that I felt a burst of energy

00:48:07.660 --> 00:48:09.040
And then I was able to get the sword

00:48:11.420 --> 00:48:12.420
No wonder

00:48:13.170 --> 00:48:17.590
You always learned everything faster than others

00:48:18.760 --> 00:48:22.600
You learned to walk and run much earlier than Dan Gu

00:48:23.390 --> 00:48:25.680
And I started talking earlier

00:48:26.850 --> 00:48:28.270
I remember this

00:48:29.060 --> 00:48:32.520
Until I found out that my energy gates were locked,

00:48:34.150 --> 00:48:36.650
I thought I would become the strongest man

00:48:42.030 --> 00:48:43.280
Uk

00:48:44.740 --> 00:48:48.790
You are smart and learn things quickly

00:48:51.290 --> 00:48:55.590
Maybe you will become a merchant and learn how to run a business?

00:48:56.170 --> 00:49:00.840
Or Master Ho Yeom will take you on as a student and teach you medicine

00:49:05.640 --> 00:49:06.680
I refuse

00:49:09.730 --> 00:49:12.980
I will train in Jeongjingak and become a magician

00:49:13.650 --> 00:49:14.730
Why?

00:49:15.690 --> 00:49:18.400
Because that's what your father did?

00:49:20.320 --> 00:49:23.490
Do you want to become the next Gwangju Jeonbugwan?

00:49:24.160 --> 00:49:26.910
Yes, and I will become it

00:49:27.990 --> 00:49:29.620
I'll take his place

00:49:29.700 --> 00:49:32.750
and I will prove to these scoundrels who did not believe that I am his son

00:49:34.330 --> 00:49:36.250
- I'll silence them all
- You...

00:49:38.460 --> 00:49:39.960
not son

00:49:41.220 --> 00:49:42.300
Chan Gan

00:49:45.640 --> 00:49:46.930
You

00:49:47.640 --> 00:49:50.850
the fruit of your mother's betrayal

00:49:52.940 --> 00:49:56.310
We accepted you into the Chan family to show respect to your late mother.

00:49:56.400 --> 00:49:59.190
But we can't let you become the head of Jeonbugwan.

00:49:59.280 --> 00:50:02.400
So stop dreaming of following in the footsteps

00:50:05.450 --> 00:50:06.410
his father

00:50:07.870 --> 00:50:11.200
Remain a clueless heir

00:50:11.910 --> 00:50:14.460
Chan family

00:50:16.330 --> 00:50:17.460
And then

00:50:19.210 --> 00:50:21.300
we will continue to take care of you

00:50:28.970 --> 00:50:30.060
Then...

00:50:33.230 --> 00:50:34.850
Then who is my father?

00:50:37.610 --> 00:50:41.480
How do we know who your dead mother is with?

00:50:44.150 --> 00:50:45.910
cheated on him?

00:51:20.400 --> 00:51:24.150
Uka has a lot of thoughts in his head right now, leave him alone

00:51:30.870 --> 00:51:32.740
Make sure he eats everything

00:51:42.550 --> 00:51:45.420
Maid Kim ordered me to make sure you eat everything

00:51:49.090 --> 00:51:50.470
Did he scold you again?

00:51:52.810 --> 00:51:55.350
I thought you were used to being scolded...

00:52:07.700 --> 00:52:08.860
I have nothing to do with it

00:52:08.950 --> 00:52:12.240
They probably haven't fixed the passage yet after that incident.

00:52:14.950 --> 00:52:15.870
Don't move

00:52:17.660 --> 00:52:19.000
Just stand there

00:52:22.750 --> 00:52:24.800
Everything can collapse

00:52:27.210 --> 00:52:28.800
So just stand still

00:52:41.690 --> 00:52:44.690
Why didn't you dodge the sword?

00:52:45.730 --> 00:52:46.780
It's because

00:52:47.280 --> 00:52:49.740
Did you need another reason to kick him out?

00:52:50.780 --> 00:52:52.780
I deserve it

00:52:52.870 --> 00:52:56.450
Cause I broke his heart

00:52:58.040 --> 00:53:02.330
Breaking his heart must have hurt more than taking a hit.

00:53:04.170 --> 00:53:05.290
Maid Kim

00:53:06.130 --> 00:53:11.130
You said there are rumors that I'm Wook's father?

00:53:11.680 --> 00:53:13.590
What if I said

00:53:14.260 --> 00:53:18.350
that I'm really his father?

00:53:22.140 --> 00:53:24.360
I will leave my position

00:53:25.980 --> 00:53:28.320
I'll start a small business

00:53:29.530 --> 00:53:31.650
and I’ll start trading with Ukom

00:53:32.240 --> 00:53:34.990
Pine Forest needs a head

00:53:37.030 --> 00:53:38.580
Or maybe he can say

00:53:39.500 --> 00:53:41.540
What am I his mother?

00:53:42.330 --> 00:53:43.540
I think it will be better

00:53:43.620 --> 00:53:47.090
if Wook and I go to my home village where Mrs. Do Hwa and I grew up

00:53:49.590 --> 00:53:52.300
This won't happen

00:53:53.930 --> 00:53:58.430
Wook looks like Do Hwa so

00:53:59.560 --> 00:54:01.850
he's so handsome

00:54:02.940 --> 00:54:04.150
Who will believe in

00:54:06.440 --> 00:54:08.020
What are you his mother?

00:54:10.230 --> 00:54:11.240
Wait

00:54:12.030 --> 00:54:15.870
So, if I were his mother, he would be ugly?

00:54:16.870 --> 00:54:19.240
For that matter, you can't be his father either

00:54:19.330 --> 00:54:20.830
Of course I can

00:54:21.580 --> 00:54:24.040
Chang Gan and I always kept pace,

00:54:28.290 --> 00:54:30.710
when it came to appearance

00:54:33.840 --> 00:54:34.970
No, you were losing

00:54:35.550 --> 00:54:37.090
You're not even close to him

00:54:37.180 --> 00:54:41.310
Do Hwa said that she likes everything about you except your appearance.

00:54:41.390 --> 00:54:43.560
Don't make things up!

00:54:44.770 --> 00:54:46.600
You didn't even flinch when you were hit with a sword

00:54:46.690 --> 00:54:48.980
But I guess it hurts more to hear that you're scary

00:54:49.060 --> 00:54:50.320
wound

00:54:51.860 --> 00:54:53.860
it hurts a lot

00:54:53.940 --> 00:54:55.610
Aren't you pretending?

00:54:55.700 --> 00:54:58.240
Don't move or the wound will open

00:55:00.280 --> 00:55:01.490
We share

00:55:03.700 --> 00:55:05.750
same pain

00:55:07.250 --> 00:55:09.840
rejected by people

00:55:09.920 --> 00:55:12.420
who were loved

00:55:12.920 --> 00:55:14.340
So let's

00:55:15.590 --> 00:55:17.010
let's not hurt each other

00:55:18.800 --> 00:55:22.390
I admit that I didn’t want to offend you

00:55:22.470 --> 00:55:23.850
You...

00:55:25.980 --> 00:55:26.980
kra...

00:55:30.190 --> 00:55:31.270
kra...

00:55:32.530 --> 00:55:34.030
beautiful

00:55:36.400 --> 00:55:40.450
You too, maid Kim,

00:55:41.740 --> 00:55:42.950
kra...

00:55:44.080 --> 00:55:47.290
beautiful...i

00:55:55.010 --> 00:55:57.970
Let me blow on your wound

00:55:58.630 --> 00:55:59.840
It hurts

00:56:03.260 --> 00:56:04.930
Just below

00:56:05.020 --> 00:56:06.560
Yes, yes, there

00:56:18.110 --> 00:56:19.530
Seems to be an amulet in Jwiseonru

00:56:19.610 --> 00:56:21.620
belongs to Chan Wook

00:56:22.910 --> 00:56:23.910
Chan Wook?

00:56:23.990 --> 00:56:26.790
He was recently punished for losing an amulet

00:56:26.870 --> 00:56:30.620
And I heard that his maid often goes to that place

00:56:33.670 --> 00:56:36.460
This girl from Sosnovy Bor is his maid,

00:56:37.670 --> 00:56:40.840
and she was in the tavern that day

00:56:43.220 --> 00:56:44.510
Could she be

00:56:45.470 --> 00:56:46.470
Nak Soo?

00:56:50.520 --> 00:56:53.690
Are we still far from Jeonbugwan?

00:56:57.110 --> 00:57:00.450
At this rate I'll turn to stone

00:57:01.320 --> 00:57:03.070
We'll speed up, just be patient.

00:57:03.620 --> 00:57:05.530
You can't lose control now

00:57:06.410 --> 00:57:09.000
Mister, are you okay?

00:57:36.980 --> 00:57:39.610
Turn back

00:58:00.300 --> 00:58:04.890
Your hand... You comprehended Ryusa for such

00:58:04.970 --> 00:58:07.390
short time

00:58:08.760 --> 00:58:11.980
You are as smart as your father

00:58:14.850 --> 00:58:16.310
Jin Moo from Jeonbugwan

00:58:16.400 --> 00:58:20.320
started an argument only because he realized that the post of Gwangju would not be possible for him

00:58:20.400 --> 00:58:22.570
He realized that you

00:58:22.650 --> 00:58:25.700
eldest son of the Jang family, will you take this position

00:58:34.290 --> 00:58:37.170
Uncle's wound is not so deep

00:58:37.250 --> 00:58:38.710
Don't worry about him

00:58:38.790 --> 00:58:42.260
I'll talk to Jin Mu

00:58:42.340 --> 00:58:43.380
Okay?

00:58:49.430 --> 00:58:50.930
Take care of him

00:59:19.380 --> 00:59:21.340
Wook is always in danger when you're around

00:59:23.010 --> 00:59:24.670
You were with him when he drank poison

00:59:24.760 --> 00:59:27.590
and when he grappled with the Crown Prince

00:59:29.800 --> 00:59:33.390
So, do you want to separate us?

00:59:33.470 --> 00:59:34.680
I can't do this

00:59:38.020 --> 00:59:40.230
He always got what he wanted

00:59:40.860 --> 00:59:42.650
And you risked your life to save him

00:59:49.320 --> 00:59:51.200
This is his father's sword

00:59:51.280 --> 00:59:52.990
Take it

01:00:21.440 --> 01:00:23.480
I can't look at this anymore!

01:00:23.570 --> 01:00:25.230
How long will you feel sorry for yourself?

01:00:32.200 --> 01:00:33.410
Get up

01:00:45.670 --> 01:00:48.840
You received enormous energy and were able to cope with it

01:00:49.590 --> 01:00:53.390
It takes people 10 years to do this, it took you 10 days.

01:00:53.470 --> 01:00:55.470
- Our training...
- Forget it

01:00:55.560 --> 01:00:56.970
I don't want to!

01:00:59.980 --> 01:01:01.690
Refusing because of a few words from Park Jin?

01:01:02.440 --> 01:01:04.520
So it was not strength, but stupidity

01:01:04.610 --> 01:01:07.480
No wonder you're so desperate. You are too weak!

01:01:07.570 --> 01:01:10.360
Yes, I'm a weakling, so I won't do anything

01:01:10.450 --> 01:01:11.910
So just shut up

01:01:13.700 --> 01:01:15.330
Shut your mouth and don't bother me

01:01:23.170 --> 01:01:25.380
I don't need a student who is idle

01:01:29.720 --> 01:01:31.300
Then don't be my teacher

01:01:32.430 --> 01:01:33.930
you will be my maid

01:01:35.010 --> 01:01:36.930
If you make me angry again, I'll sell it

01:02:16.090 --> 01:02:17.220
Mister

01:02:19.430 --> 01:02:24.060
The owner is so worried that he doesn’t even drink water.

01:02:24.140 --> 01:02:26.100
Help please

01:02:26.190 --> 01:02:27.770
But what can I do?

01:02:28.440 --> 01:02:30.280
We'd better wait for uncle to sort everything out.

01:02:30.360 --> 01:02:33.610
Master Ho Yeom said he would help

01:02:33.700 --> 01:02:37.410
Ask him to meet Jin Mu quickly and put an end to this

01:02:42.160 --> 01:02:46.830
I came to you because I'm worried about how small you would be

01:02:46.920 --> 01:02:49.340
didn't inflate the problem

01:02:49.420 --> 01:02:53.800
How can threatening the life of the Crown Prince be a small thing?

01:02:56.340 --> 01:02:59.510
That's why our leader locked him up

01:03:00.140 --> 01:03:02.890
Pine Forest will punish him

01:03:02.980 --> 01:03:05.810
When it comes to the royal family, Sosnovy Bor should not interfere

01:03:06.520 --> 01:03:10.270
It is Jeonbugwan's responsibility, we will punish him ourselves

01:03:11.020 --> 01:03:13.150
So what will you do?

01:03:13.240 --> 01:03:17.070
He threatened the Crown Prince, he should be executed

01:03:19.280 --> 01:03:23.160
But we can't kill the only son of Gwangju

01:03:23.830 --> 01:03:27.670
So let's just cut off the hand that pointed the sword at the prince.

01:03:28.330 --> 01:03:30.250
Cut off your hand?

01:03:30.340 --> 01:03:31.880
You were probably offended by

01:03:31.960 --> 01:03:34.210
that your student could not defeat Uka,

01:03:34.300 --> 01:03:37.010
the energy gates of which were opened just ten days ago

01:03:37.090 --> 01:03:39.890
Stupid, I'm trying to save your and the prince's reputation here.

01:03:39.970 --> 01:03:42.220
Was going to be nice

01:03:42.310 --> 01:03:43.930
But you're completely crazy!

01:03:44.020 --> 01:03:47.770
Let Jeonbugwan decide whether I'm crazy or Chan Wook

01:03:47.850 --> 01:03:50.900
- Bastard...
- Master, calm down

01:03:52.650 --> 01:03:55.320
Their fight was by mutual consent

01:03:55.900 --> 01:03:58.280
The maid Uka is to blame for what happened

01:04:01.240 --> 01:04:03.040
The fight was fair

01:04:04.240 --> 01:04:08.920
If you don't believe us, let them fight again

01:04:13.170 --> 01:04:16.760
Again? Good idea

01:04:18.260 --> 01:04:21.260
Since you claim that Wook did not threaten the Crown Prince,

01:04:21.350 --> 01:04:22.930
and the fight was fair,

01:04:23.810 --> 01:04:26.770
let the official match take place

01:04:27.390 --> 01:04:29.690
A duel between Uk and the prince?

01:04:30.270 --> 01:04:33.230
If you can't accept this, give Uka to us

01:04:33.320 --> 01:04:34.730
But if you agree,

01:04:34.820 --> 01:04:39.240
we will not hold anyone accountable, even if one of them dies

01:04:40.110 --> 01:04:42.490
According to the customs of the Deho magicians

01:04:53.420 --> 01:04:56.210
We came to figure everything out, and what’s the end result?

01:04:56.800 --> 01:05:00.970
It was the underwater snake that got the better of me

01:05:01.050 --> 01:05:04.050
Uk will die in official combat. What should we do?

01:05:04.140 --> 01:05:05.430
Don't worry

01:05:05.510 --> 01:05:07.850
The Crown Prince will not accept the challenge

01:05:08.930 --> 01:05:11.480
Since Master So Kyung founded Pine Forest,

01:05:11.560 --> 01:05:14.940
the royal family and magicians did not compete

01:05:15.020 --> 01:05:16.530
Both sides adhered

01:05:16.610 --> 01:05:21.490
this unspoken rule, so as not to waste energy

01:05:22.070 --> 01:05:23.160
It can't be

01:05:23.240 --> 01:05:26.620
for the Crown Prince to break these rules and go against Wook

01:05:35.630 --> 01:05:37.340
Please accept the challenge

01:05:38.510 --> 01:05:42.720
I don’t understand why I have to go against Sosnovy Bor because of this idiot

01:05:42.800 --> 01:05:46.810
They themselves made it so that they won’t point fingers at us

01:05:46.890 --> 01:05:51.180
Show Sosnovy Bor how strong you are

01:06:11.330 --> 01:06:13.420
Royal guards and people of Jeonbugwan

01:06:14.000 --> 01:06:15.170
What's going on?

01:06:15.790 --> 01:06:17.790
To you, Master Ho

01:06:18.590 --> 01:06:20.550
He said it won't happen

01:06:20.630 --> 01:06:22.300
But look

01:06:23.180 --> 01:06:24.720
What should we do now?

01:06:27.680 --> 01:06:30.560
I don't understand why they are here?

01:06:30.640 --> 01:06:34.310
I was just about to tell you

01:06:34.390 --> 01:06:36.520
But Jin Mu was ahead of me

01:06:37.940 --> 01:06:39.110
Jin Mu?

01:06:39.900 --> 01:06:42.240
Did something happen again?

01:06:44.150 --> 01:06:45.570
To them all!

01:06:45.660 --> 01:06:47.490
Crown Prince

01:06:47.570 --> 01:06:50.240
challenged Chan Wook to a duel

01:06:52.500 --> 01:06:56.460
Deputy Gwangju said that we should take Chang Wook to Jeonbugwan,

01:06:56.540 --> 01:06:58.960
if he refuses the fight

01:06:59.540 --> 01:07:02.460
Chan Wook is already locked here

01:07:04.300 --> 01:07:07.800
Deliver to Jeonbugwan? For what?

01:07:07.890 --> 01:07:09.600
Ask Master Ho

01:07:10.390 --> 01:07:13.680
I was told that you agreed to these conditions

01:07:22.480 --> 01:07:25.450
Uk, get up. You need to run away from here

01:07:26.200 --> 01:07:27.280
What's the matter?

01:07:27.360 --> 01:07:30.740
There's no time to explain. If we don't hurry, you'll lose your hand

01:07:31.660 --> 01:07:33.410
You might even die

01:07:34.000 --> 01:07:35.290
- What?
- Owner

01:07:35.870 --> 01:07:37.420
Everything has become more serious

01:07:37.500 --> 01:07:40.000
Stay here, then you'll lose your hand or your life.

01:07:41.040 --> 01:07:42.500
Are you going to sit like that?

01:07:53.850 --> 01:07:58.400
I will go with Uk to the palace and meet the Crown Prince

01:07:58.980 --> 01:08:00.940
Uk will be here soon

01:08:05.530 --> 01:08:06.490
Where is Uk?

01:08:06.570 --> 01:08:09.820
He's not in the secret room. I think he ran away

01:08:10.530 --> 01:08:11.530
What?

01:08:18.710 --> 01:08:21.170
When you're stuck between a rock and a hard place,

01:08:21.250 --> 01:08:23.210
escape is the only way out

01:08:31.180 --> 01:08:34.100
He was here the whole time. Only his maid came in and out

01:08:34.680 --> 01:08:36.270
I don't understand how he escaped

01:08:38.890 --> 01:08:40.850
Where are Yul and Dan Gu?

01:08:49.610 --> 01:08:53.240
The head will sort everything out. Keep your head down until things calm down

01:08:54.580 --> 01:08:57.330
Moo Deok, take care of him

01:08:58.250 --> 01:09:01.250
Are you sure we don’t need you and me?

01:09:01.330 --> 01:09:03.840
Yes we will go to my home village

01:09:03.920 --> 01:09:05.880
Sari village, right?

01:09:05.960 --> 01:09:08.800
Stay there. We'll come for you

01:09:14.890 --> 01:09:17.100
You put him in danger again

01:09:20.350 --> 01:09:22.730
And he will get what he wants again

01:09:50.010 --> 01:09:51.340
The fight will take place

01:09:52.630 --> 01:09:56.430
mid next month

01:09:59.890 --> 01:10:01.230
But if

01:10:02.100 --> 01:10:03.980
he won't appear on that day

01:10:05.810 --> 01:10:07.820
take it as defeat

01:10:07.900 --> 01:10:10.360
It's escape, not defeat

01:10:12.450 --> 01:10:15.120
I think such cowards should be punished

01:10:17.700 --> 01:10:19.330
I agree with him

01:10:19.950 --> 01:10:22.250
If Chang Wook doesn't come back,

01:10:22.830 --> 01:10:25.130
he will be deprived of the right to become

01:10:26.080 --> 01:10:27.170
next Gwangju

01:10:35.090 --> 01:10:37.350
So be it, Your Majesty

01:10:54.950 --> 01:10:57.030
Why did you take it if we're running away?

01:10:58.370 --> 01:10:59.780
For training

01:10:59.870 --> 01:11:01.080
Training?

01:11:01.160 --> 01:11:02.450
Are we going to train?

01:11:04.040 --> 01:11:05.080
Are you behind this?

01:11:05.170 --> 01:11:06.620
Contributed

01:11:07.130 --> 01:11:09.960
You finally moved when I said you were in danger

01:11:12.050 --> 01:11:13.300
What?

01:11:13.380 --> 01:11:15.470
I don't want a student who isn't making progress.

01:11:16.260 --> 01:11:18.850
Just die if you're not going to do anything.

01:11:18.930 --> 01:11:20.760
You poisoned me again

01:11:21.930 --> 01:11:23.640
my crazy master

01:11:24.310 --> 01:11:25.350
Chan Wook

01:11:26.140 --> 01:11:29.520
We're going to where I trained. Get ready

01:11:30.150 --> 01:11:33.610
There will be no warm baths there

01:11:33.690 --> 01:11:38.280
No beds, no your favorite food

01:11:40.450 --> 01:11:43.410
Is Sari Village so scary?

01:11:44.250 --> 01:11:46.870
Moo Dok lived in Sari

01:11:46.960 --> 01:11:48.920
Nak Su is from the same place

01:11:50.000 --> 01:11:51.380
from Danhyangok

01:11:53.760 --> 01:11:55.470
That's where we're heading

01:12:25.940 --> 01:12:40.320
/////////////////////////////////////

01:12:33.940 --> 01:12:48.320
Thanks for watching with us!

01:12:48.320 --> 01:12:51.300
Alchemy

01:12:48.320 --> 01:12:51.300
Shower

01:12:51.940 --> 01:12:53.730
What is all this?

01:12:53.820 --> 01:12:54.940
Moo Dok!

01:12:55.020 --> 01:12:58.030
I almost took this for an attempt to kidnap me and live with me

01:12:58.110 --> 01:12:59.780
under the guise of training

01:12:59.860 --> 01:13:02.820
Just so you know, I can teach you differently.

01:13:02.910 --> 01:13:05.620
These girls are the most dangerous

01:13:05.700 --> 01:13:07.200
I don't like sweets

01:13:07.290 --> 01:13:09.500
Well, please, if you don’t love me

01:13:09.580 --> 01:13:12.920
- Yul is cooking rice with Moo Deok!
- I told you...

01:13:13.000 --> 01:13:16.920
How can you teach someone else when your student is here?

01:13:17.010 --> 01:13:20.090
What if we deprive him of the right to be called a magician?

01:13:20.170 --> 01:13:23.050
Wherever he goes, he can't find a teacher

01:13:23.140 --> 01:13:26.310
An amazing soul migrated into this body

01:13:26.390 --> 01:13:27.350
Moo Deok, run!

01:13:27.430 --> 01:13:28.730
I didn't want to do anything...

01:13:28.810 --> 01:13:30.310
but something is bothering me
